# Version DOI for v1.0.3: not yet assigned at the time of this commit.
#
# A DOI cannot exist before the release it identifies. The v1.0.3 version DOI is added in a
# documentation commit made after Zenodo archives the v1.0.3 release, exactly as was done for
# v1.0.2. Until then no version DOI is recorded here, because the v1.0.2 version DOI
# (10.5281/zenodo.22544765) identifies the v1.0.2 archive and must not be presented as though
# it identified v1.0.3.
#
# The concept DOI below is version-independent and always resolves to the most recent version,
# so it remains correct at every point in this sequence.
